---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About MyToolMint" description="Why MyToolMint builds simple, fast and trustworthy tools for everyday problems."><section class="container page"><p class="eyebrow">About MyToolMint</p><h1 class="display-title">Less friction. More getting things done.</h1><p class="lead">MyToolMint is being built around a simple idea: everyday online tools should be quick, clear and genuinely helpful. No unnecessary accounts, confusing interfaces or features added only for show.</p><div class="principles"><article><strong>Useful first</strong><p>Every tool must solve a real problem well.</p></article><article><strong>Fast by default</strong><p>Pages stay lightweight and tools respond quickly.</p></article><article><strong>Built to trust</strong><p>Clear wording, sensible privacy and no misleading functionality.</p></article></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.page{padding-block:clamp(4rem,10vw,8rem)}.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:4rem}.principles article{padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:#fff}.principles strong{font-size:1.2rem}.principles p{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:44rem){.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
